{"id":"n30159-2-3","stage":1,"title":"옷 · 食物外衣","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30159-2-3-1","ko":"엄마, 제가 도울 일 없어요?","zh":"妈妈，有什么我能帮忙的吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제가","audio":"/audio/c1f551b0d681d02645e2.mp3"}},{"text":"도울","meaning":"能帮忙的","explanation":"도울 일 是“可以帮忙做的事”；这里向妈妈主动询问是否需要帮忙。","readings":[{"term":"돕다","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17203","senseId":"1","lemma":"돕다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도울","audio":"/audio/c5b9495e6d03a568f19e.mp3"}},{"text":"일","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}},{"text":"없어요?","meaning":"没有吗、有什么吗","explanation":"제가 도울 일 없어요? 字面问“没有我能帮的事吗”，自然表达为“有什么我能帮忙的吗？”。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어요","audio":"/audio/a3a387384b956d187d4f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"7feaaecf170e0c6a","term":"돕다","zh":"帮，帮助","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3","entryId":"17203","definition":"给别人正在做的事打下手或添帮手。","pronunciation":["돕ː따"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/bc6ac4c07ff854b441c9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n30159-2-3-2","ko":"새우에 튀김 가루 옷을 묻혀 주렴.","zh":"给虾裹上一层炸粉吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"새우에","meaning":"虾","explanation":"새우：虾；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"새우","audio":"/audio/fd7862fa6687a6088a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63367","senseId":"1","lemma":"새우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새우에","audio":"/audio/eebe55c67305b9dccaca.mp3"}},{"text":"튀김","meaning":"油炸用的","explanation":"튀김 가루 合起来指油炸时使用的炸粉；这里不是单独一道油炸食品。","readings":[{"term":"튀김","audio":"/audio/a0b9e6d18fa4c97ed0ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82383","senseId":"1","lemma":"튀김","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"튀김","audio":"/audio/a0b9e6d18fa4c97ed0ba.mp3"}},{"text":"가루","meaning":"粉、炸粉","explanation":"튀김 가루 是裹在虾外面的炸粉。","readings":[{"term":"가루","audio":"/audio/42864a47196d1d848539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65209","senseId":"1","lemma":"가루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가루","audio":"/audio/42864a47196d1d848539.mp3"}},{"text":"옷을","meaning":"外衣、裹层","explanation":"这里的 옷 是比喻用法，指裹在虾表面的一层炸粉；不是穿的衣服。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"2","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷을","audio":"/audio/76fa7acf1b0008045d0c.mp3"}},{"text":"묻혀","meaning":"沾上，染上","explanation":"묻히다：沾上，染上；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"묻히다","audio":"/audio/28120c6c18d8503b1de4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15725","senseId":"1","lemma":"묻히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"묻혀","audio":"/audio/8c3b9edf0b4a014efd99.mp3"}},{"text":"주렴.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주렴","audio":"/audio/154d404a6eedbf829754.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fd7862fa6687a608","term":"새우","zh":"虾","audio":"/audio/fd7862fa6687a6088a81.mp3","entryId":"63367","definition":"弯背长须多脚的水生小动物。","pronunciation":["새우"]},{"id":"a0b9e6d18fa4c97e","term":"튀김","zh":"油炸用的（튀김 가루）","audio":"/audio/a0b9e6d18fa4c97ed0ba.mp3","entryId":"82383","definition":"与 가루 合用指炸粉，用来裹在虾表面。","pronunciation":["튀김"]},{"id":"42864a47196d1d84","term":"가루","zh":"粉末，面儿","audio":"/audio/42864a47196d1d848539.mp3","entryId":"65209","definition":"坚硬的物体被粉碎或磨得很小。","pronunciation":["가루"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"食物外衣、裹层","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"裹在食物表面的一层粉浆或面糊；本句指虾身上的炸粉。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"28120c6c18d8503b","term":"묻히다","zh":"沾上，染上","audio":"/audio/28120c6c18d8503b1de4.mp3","entryId":"15725","definition":"将液体或粉末等附在其它物体上，使其留下痕迹。","pronunciation":["무치다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/05a6a76835274a15d91e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.582,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=30159","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/license